   A1 THE VHF PA HELD TO ITS 30 W SERVICE BY ITS MAKER'S OWN OUTPUT CONTROL (a closed loop on VGG, board D)
      today: board D sets VGG open-loop to 4.30 to 4.68 V (gen_sch_d.py), so nothing holds Pout under the module's 45 W rating; the budget's
