        > 40 % at VDD 12.5 V, VGG 5 V); the sheet names VGG as the output control and designs its heat sink at Pout 30 W, VDD 12.5 V, 40 %:
        IDD 0.84 + 5.16 A, 75.0 W (PRINTED as the maker's design condition, not as a limit under VGG control)
      the change: a forward-power detector and a VGG loop on board D whose low end is the 30 W service; the PA's DC figure at the loop's
        high end over the maker's 40 %, by the loop's half-tolerance (the loop is not designed: three bounds):
