          0.080 Ohm with U4's lower efficiencies as well 15.9406 V
        +-1.00 dB: Pout at most 47.55 W, the PA 118.87 W (rail 8.614 A against U13's 7.0957 A): the case 247.070 W, needs 15.8513 V; with the printed
          gauge bound and the dock contacts' maximum 16.4230 V (R_cell covered to 0.0197 Ohm); modules at 8 W 17.1100 V; D-11's basis 17.1213 V; R_cell
          0.080 Ohm with U4's lower efficiencies as well 17.4431 V
